Feature: Login to Knowledge Navigator

  As a registered user
  In order to access the Knowledge Navigator platform
  The user must be able to log in via Keycloak authentication

  Scenario: Successful login via Keycloak
    Given the user opens the login page of Knowledge Navigator
    When the user clicks the "Mit Keycloak anmelden" button
    And the user clicks the "Fortfahren" button
    And the user enters a valid username
    And the user enters a valid password
    And the user confirms the "stay signed in" prompt
    Then the user should be redirected to the Knowledge Navigator homepage


Feature: AI Response Time Measurement

  As a system performance analyst
  In order to ensure acceptable response times
  The user needs to measure the AI response time for a set of prompts

  @ai-test
  Scenario: Measure response time for Einfacher Assistent
    Given the user is successfully logged into the system
    When the user opens the application "Einfacher Assistent"
    Then the user sends 2 prompts and the system measures the AI response time for each




